    "note": "As passed by the House (02_PH); later Senate amendments are not in the text read. Section 1 also amends R.C. 3761.16: adds 'or a mob' to riot cordon power and strikes the power to prohibit sale or transport of firearms, ammunition and explosives in cordoned areas. Hunting/fishing protection (C)(7)-(9), civil remedies (E) and severability (F) omitted from quote for length."
